<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Premier to buy back FAI's stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Premier to buy back FAI's stake.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Investments Ltd said on Tuesday it had reached agreement with FAI Insurances Ltd to buy back and then cancel the insurance company's 14.7 percent stake in Premier for A$8.592 million.</p>
</text>
